Limit: the Gateway creates PENDING only through claim_pending with message_id=str(event.message_id), serialized via _wire_id as a positive integer, so a production PENDING always names its message
Warn: this supersedes r-receiptlookupdiag2 on PENDING: a PENDING must name message_id as a positive safe integer; a null message_id is SCHEMA message_id-type (audited, shown by doctor), exactly as in a terminal receipt (R1074-04)
